<!doctype html><html lang="pt-BR"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title><?=e($title)?> · Ponte</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/app.css"></head><body class="install-page"><main class="login-card"><div class="brand-mark">p</div><p class="eyebrow">PONTE · GATEWAY OFICIAL</p><h1>Cadastre sua empresa.</h1><p class="muted">Crie seu acesso e informe o número WhatsApp da empresa. A conexão com a Meta pode ser configurada depois.</p><?php if ($error): ?><div class="notice error"><?=e($error)?></div><?php endif; ?><form method="post" class="form-stack"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<?=e(csrf_token())?>"><label>Nome da empresa<input name="company_name" required maxlength="180" autocomplete="organization" value="<?=e($_POST['company_name']??'')?>"></label><label>Seu nome<input name="name" required maxlength="160" autocomplete="name" value="<?=e($_POST['name']??'')?>"></label><label>E-mail<input name="email" type="email" required maxlength="190" autocomplete="email" value="<?=e($_POST['email']??'')?>"></label><label>Senha<input name="password" type="password" required minlength="12" maxlength="128" autocomplete="new-password"><small>Use pelo menos 12 caracteres.</small></label><label>Número WhatsApp da empresa<input name="whatsapp_phone" type="tel" required inputmode="tel" autocomplete="tel" placeholder="5511999999999" value="<?=e($_POST['whatsapp_phone']??'')?>"><small>Informe o número com DDI. Este campo recebe o telefone, não o Phone Number ID da Meta.</small></label><button class="button primary" type="submit">Criar conta <span>→</span></button></form><p class="tiny center">Já tem acesso? <a href="?r=login">Entrar</a></p></main></body></html>
